{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00706","headline":"郊庙歌辞 仪坤庙乐章 安和 · 刘子玄","name":"郊庙歌辞 仪坤庙乐章 安和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妙筭申帷幄，神谋及庙庭。\n两阶文物备，七德武功成。\n校猎长杨苑，屯军细柳营。\n将军献凯入，歌舞溢重城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘子玄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00706.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00706","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}